&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fingerprint&lt;/strong&gt; empowers enterprises to detect and stop online fraud with the world’s most accurate device intelligence.&amp;nbsp; We lead our industry with bleeding-edge identification capabilities and work on turning new ideas and discoveries in the fraud detection space into reality. Our customers range from innovative startups to leading enterprise companies, including Plaid, Dropbox, and Booking.com.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fingerprint is a globally dispersed, 100% remote company.&lt;/strong&gt; We were named on on the 2026 Forbes Best Startup Employers list and ranked #803 on the 2026 Inc. 5000 list of America’s fastest-growing private companies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.crunchbase.com/organization/fingerprintjs&quot;&gt;We have raised $77M &lt;/a&gt;and are backed by Craft Ventures (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.tesla.com/&quot;&gt;Tesla, &lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://facebook.com/&quot;&gt;Facebook, &lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.airbnb.com/&quot;&gt;Airbnb &lt;/a&gt;), Nexus Venture Partners ( &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.postman.com/&quot;&gt;Postman&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.apollo.io/&quot;&gt;Apollo.io,&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://min.io/&quot;&gt;MinIO&lt;/a&gt;, Druva) and Uncorrelated Ventures ( &lt;a href=&quot;https://redis.io/&quot;&gt;Redis, &lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://rollbar.com/&quot;&gt;Rollbar, &lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://gradle.org/&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Gradle&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an IT Support Specialist to join our team and be the primary point of contact for desktop support across a fully remote company. Your main responsibility will be keeping our people productive and secure by supporting laptops, accounts and the everyday tools that our teams rely on. This is a hands-on, people-facing role, you will spend most of your time talking directly with employees, troubleshooting their issues and making sure they feel heard and helped along the way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Since almost every interaction starts with someone who is stuck and needs help quickly, this role requires strong communication skills and genuine comfort working with people at every level of the company. You will also need to be comfortable learning and supporting a broad set of tools rather than specializing deeply in one area. Familiarity with device management and identity platforms is important, and a willingness to keep learning as our stack evolves is a must.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A key aspect of this role involves building trust with a distributed team so that people feel comfortable reaching out early rather than working around a problem or letting it get worse.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ticket Triage &amp;amp; Support: &lt;/strong&gt;Provide remote support for hardware, software, and account issues via chat, tickets, and video; perform initial triage and routing to ensure timely resolution while identifying recurring problems to suggest long-term fixes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Device &amp;amp; Asset Management: &lt;/strong&gt;Handle the end-to-end device lifecycle for a remote workforce, including provisioning, asset tracking, and macOS-specific troubleshooting and system updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Access &amp;amp; SaaS Administration: &lt;/strong&gt;Manage identity and access tools (Okta), process SaaS access requests, configure core tools (e.g., Google Workspace, Jira), and participate in periodic access reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Support &amp;amp; Knowledge Sharing: &lt;/strong&gt;Document solutions to build our knowledge base, handle ad-hoc administrative requests (e.g., data exports, config changes), and collaborate with IT/Security teams on onboarding and compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience: &lt;/strong&gt;2+ years of experience in an IT support or helpdesk role, including experience supporting a remote or hybrid workforce and managing multiple ticket priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication: &lt;/strong&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, with a user-centric approach to troubleshooting and a genuine interest in helping people resolve technical frustration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Skills: &lt;/strong&gt;Solid working knowledge of macOS environments and Google Workspace administration, alongside experience with identity/access tools (e.g., Okta) and mobile device management (e.g., Iru, Jamf).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptability: &lt;/strong&gt;Comfort learning and troubleshooting a wide range of SaaS tools (e.g., Jira, Salesforce) and a proactive attitude toward mastering new technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure &amp;amp; Security: &lt;/strong&gt;Familiarity with basic networking (VPN, Wi-Fi, DNS) and exposure to security fundamentals, including MFA, endpoint protection, and compliance frameworks (e.g., SOC 2, ISO 27001).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems &amp;amp; Documentation: &lt;/strong&gt;Experience with ticketing systems (e.g., Jira Service Management, Zendesk) and a track record of creating internal documentation or self-service resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tools and Technologies:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identity and access: Okta&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Device management: Iru (Kandji)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Productivity: Google Workspace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaboration and ticketing: Jira, Slack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CRM: Salesforce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Transparency&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;For US-based employees, the cash compensation range for this role is $74,000– $100,000. We set standard ranges for all US roles based on function, level, and geographic location, benchmarked against similar stage growth companies. To comply with local legislation and provide greater transparency, we share salary ranges on all job postings. However, these ranges are specific to the hiring location and may differ within or outside the US. Offers vary depending on, but not limited to, relevant experience, education, certifications/licenses, skills, training, and market conditions.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Due to regulatory and security reasons, there&#39;s a small number of countries where we cannot have Fingerprint teammates based. Additionally, because Fingerprint is an all-remote company and people can join our workforce from almost any country, we do not sponsor visas. Fingerprint teammates need to be authorized to work from their home location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are dedicated to creating an inclusive work environment for everyone. We embrace and celebrate the unique experiences, perspectives and cultural backgrounds that each employee brings to our workplace. Fingerprint strives to foster an environment where our employees feel respected, valued and empowered, and our team members are at the forefront in helping us promote and sustain an inclusive workplace. We highly encourage people from underrepresented groups in tech to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are applying as a resident of California, please read our CCPA notice &lt;a href=&quot;https://dev.fingerprint.com/docs/dpa-ccpa&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are applying as a resident of the EU, please read our GDPR notice &lt;a href=&quot;https://dev.fingerprint.com/docs/dpa-gdpr&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have noticed a rise in recruiting impersonations across the industry, where scammers attempt to access candidates&#39; personal and financial information through fake interviews and offers. All Fingerprint recruiting email communications will always come from the @&lt;a href=&quot;http://fingerprint.com&quot;&gt;fingerprint.com&lt;/a&gt; domain. Any outreach claiming to be from Fingerprint via other sources should be ignored.*&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Due to regulatory and security reasons, there’s a small number of countries where we cannot have Fingerprint teammates based. Additionally, because Fingerprint is an all-remote company and people can join our workforce from almost any country, we do not sponsor visas. Fingerprint teammates need to be authorized to work from their home location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are dedicated to creating an inclusive work environment for everyone. We embrace and celebrate the unique experiences, perspectives and cultural backgrounds that each employee brings to our workplace. Fingerprint strives to foster an environment where our employees feel respected, valued and empowered, and our team members are at the forefront in helping us promote and sustain an inclusive workplace. We highly encourage people from underrepresented groups in tech to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are applying as a resident of California, please read our CCPA notice &lt;a href=&quot;https://dev.fingerprint.com/docs/dpa-ccpa&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are applying as a resident of the EU, please read our GDPR notice &lt;a href=&quot;https://dev.fingerprint.com/docs/dpa-gdpr&quot;&gt;here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;**We have noticed a rise in recruiting impersonations across the industry, where scammers attempt to access candidates&#39; personal and financial information through fake interviews and offers. All Fingerprint recruiting email communications will always come from the @fingerprint.com domain. Any outreach claiming to be from Fingerprint via other sources should be ignored.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
